    "description": "A cinematic Western fine art photograph steeped in tension and forward momentum. Wayne Heim captures a moment where choice has already been made—where the figures are small against the land, yet bound to it by consequence. Painterly textures and dramatic atmosphere invite the viewer into an unresolved journey, one shaped by terrain, resolve, and the cost of commitment. © Wayne Heim",
