    "title": "Somewhere Else to Turn",
    "description": "A quiet yet charged Western fine art photograph by Wayne Heim, capturing a solitary crossing where resolve outweighs comfort. Framed within painterly light and reflective water, the image explores the psychological terrain of choice, consequence, and motion—where even calm moments carry the weight of what lies behind and what must be faced ahead. © Wayne Heim",
